  "title": "Why Field Tickets Break Cost Reconciliation in Oil and Gas",
  "summary": "Field tickets are the financial source records connecting oilfield work to the ledger, yet their endless vendor-by-vendor variation, handwriting, and degraded scans break conventional extraction and quietly corrupt cost reconciliation, which is why Pulse uses vision-language models with normalized schemas and source-level provenance to turn them into clean, traceable, audit-ready data. | Pulse AI",
